; A flow's state is a record of events. The Flow Nexus holds a flow's state
; as the last of its transitions (memory.ethos Flow), each recorded with the
; event that caused it, for every harness alike. A harness's report is typed
; into one Event: Started, Working with the context's size, Idle with the
; context's size, Compacting, Ended. Recorded with the cause Reported, an
; event leads to its state: Started and Working to Acting, Idle to Resting,
; Ended to Asleep; Compacting keeps the state the flow was in. A request the
; Nexus delivers is recorded with the cause Arrived, its RequestId, and leads
; to Acting. The state the Nexus decides by is the last transition's.
;
; The intake is one typed Event, so its source can change without touching
; the state logic. Today a Claude flow's hooks report it: a Started of a
; session the flow had not started is Started, and a Started of a session it
; already started (a resume, or its session going on past a compaction) is
; its rest when its transcript shows its main turn ended, else Working; its
; own prompt is Working, a tool boundary Working, its own Stop Idle with the
; size its transcript shows, its own session's end Ended. A Codex flow's
; app-server reports it through its thread's turn ledger: its first report
; is preceded by Started, its thread leaving its rest into a turn or a
; running item is Working, its thread reaching its rest is Idle, a token
; usage is Working with that size while the thread is in a turn and Idle
; with it at rest, its thread closed is Ended. A compaction either harness
; makes is Compacting. Working carries the context size Flow last measured
; where the report itself carries none.
;
; Caused is one cause at one seat, at its moment. CodexReport is what a
; batch of a Codex thread's ledger events, or one token usage, says:
; Stepped, the thread's standing before and after the batch; Measured, the
; standing it stands in and the tokens its last model call carried; Closed,
; its thread closed. ClaudeReport, ReportedEvent and CodexFlowReport name
; the flow a report is of; AskedFlow the flow whose state is read; a
; TransitionWrite is one flow's record as a commit writes it, Appended when
; it was held and Opened when it is new.
;
; LeadsToState is a cause's: the state it leads to from the state before,
; None for a cause this release decides no state by (CoolingDue,
; Crystallized, and Overridden, whose override names its own state).
; TypesCodexReport is a Codex report's: the Event it is, given the size Flow
; last measured, or None when it changes nothing. SeedsReportedTransition is
; a flow's recorded harness events': the Event its last report maps to, with
; the size given, a repeated Started of one session taking the event before
; it, and a Cleared none.
;
; RecordsTransitions is the store's: a cause appended to its seat's flow as
; the transition it leads to, None when it leads to none; the records the
; arrivals of delivered requests write, which the caller commits with the
; delivery under the transitions' gate; the state a flow is in, its last transition's; and
; the Memory upgrade, run at every open: each live flow whose transitions
; hold no Reported one is given the one its last recorded report maps to,
; placed before the overrides it holds, the count answered.
;
; ReportsEvents is the Nexus's: a Claude report typed into its Event; an
; event recorded through Operation for the seat of the flow, the moment
; now; a Codex report recorded, Started first when the flow holds no
; transition yet.

Library
[ :flow_nexus:store:[ FlowStore StoreError ]                                     ; imports
  :flow_nexus:[ RunningNexus ]
  :flow_nexus:generated:memory:[ Event Cause Transition Moment Flow FlowEvents ]
  :flow_nexus:generated:overriding:[ Seat ]
  :flow_nexus:generated:turn_ledger:[ ThreadStanding ]
  :meta_signal_flow:generated:signal:[ State ]
  :signal_flow:[ FlowId Tokens HookEvent.Event ] ]
[ Caused.{ Seat Cause Moment }                                                   ; types: one cause at one seat
  CodexReport.[ Stepped.{ Before.ThreadStanding                                  ;   a Codex thread's report: a batch's step
                          After.ThreadStanding }
                Measured.{ ThreadStanding Tokens }                               ;     a token usage in its standing
                Closed ]                                                         ;     its thread closed
  ClaudeReport.{ FlowId HookEvent }                                              ;   a Claude hook's report of one flow
  ReportedEvent.{ FlowId Event }                                                 ;   one event of one flow
  CodexFlowReport.{ FlowId CodexReport }                                         ;   one Codex report of one flow
  AskedFlow.FlowId                                                               ;   the flow whose state is asked
  TransitionWrite.[ Appended.Flow                                                ;   a flow's record to write: held, one transition longer
                    Opened.Flow ] ]                                              ;     new, with its first
[ LeadsToState.[ leads_to.{ [ Option<State> ] [ Option<State> ] } ]              ; traits
  TypesCodexReport.[ codex_event.{ [ Option<Tokens> ] [ Option<Event> ] } ]
  SeedsReportedTransition.[ last_reported.{ [ Option<Tokens> ] [ Option<Event> ] } ]
  RecordsTransitions.[ record_caused.{ [ Caused ] [ Result<Option<Transition> StoreError> ] }
                       arrivals.{ [ Vector<Caused> ] [ Result<Vector<TransitionWrite> StoreError> ] }
                       state_of.{ [ AskedFlow ] [ Result<Option<State> StoreError> ] }
                       seed_reported_transitions.[ Result<Integer StoreError> ] ]
  ReportsEvents.[ claude_event.{ [ ClaudeReport ] [ Option<Event> ] }
                  report_event.{ [ ReportedEvent ] [ Boolean ] }
                  report_codex.{ [ CodexFlowReport ] [ Boolean ] } ] ]
[ Cause.[ LeadsToState ]                                                         ; associations
  CodexReport.[ TypesCodexReport ]
  FlowEvents.[ SeedsReportedTransition ]
  FlowStore.[ RecordsTransitions ]
  RunningNexus.[ ReportsEvents ] ]
